  "units": [
    {
      "id": "u_602d7e81cdf52c261164d347_0",
      "kind": "title",
      "source": "Using promoted attributes to configure scripts",
      "sourceHash": "602d7e81cdf52c261164d34736f9de48ba8435882723ebb52ee43d945caaf477",
      "context": "Using promoted attributes to configure scripts",
      "contextHash": "03b4ccffea506283d5d221ef6ec094d7a976816841073ce9322ce188c2d72f45",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "昇格された属性を使用したスクリプトの設定",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_f02770e795513fe45bb8286e_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "A good use case of promoted attributes is to easily define the various parameters a script might need, for example an input and output note if it's processing data, or a checkbox to define a particular change in behavior for the script.",
      "sourceHash": "f02770e795513fe45bb8286ebb770db53b8f6dc0d1a346798ea86d226d895d14",
      "context": "Using promoted attributes to configure scripts",
      "contextHash": "03b4ccffea506283d5d221ef6ec094d7a976816841073ce9322ce188c2d72f45",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "昇格された属性の優れたユースケースは、スクリプトが必要とする可能性のあるさまざまなパラメータ（データを処理する場合は入力ノートと出力ノート、あるいはスクリプトの動作の特定な変更を定義するためのチェックボックスなど）を簡単に定義することです。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_6ec6fb787788aef2bd193d7e_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Using check boxes to toggle flags__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "6ec6fb787788aef2bd193d7eef50b0a40d6204bac712f50fd2ec9139f99206d1",
      "context": "Using promoted attributes to configure scripts > Using check boxes to toggle flags",
      "contextHash": "80082c340ed62fddd93cdfe7a602e70140767e4e7412b2735010cfbb471ae10e",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "チェックボックスを使用したフラグの切り替え__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c79c4c117f3f96065dcb7442_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Instead of asking the user to modify a boolean value in the script, it's much more intuitive to use a checkbox for it as a promoted attribute.",
      "sourceHash": "c79c4c117f3f96065dcb744288e8927164e14e7d84d3e33d3a4a8fa195842209",
      "context": "Using promoted attributes to configure scripts > Using check boxes to toggle flags",
      "contextHash": "80082c340ed62fddd93cdfe7a602e70140767e4e7412b2735010cfbb471ae10e",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "ユーザーにスクリプト内のブール値を変更してもらう代わりに、昇格された属性としてチェックボックスを使用する方がはるかに直感的です。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_ff97a7a0f5a9c5aba1086d0e_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To do so, first define the promoted attribute:",
      "sourceHash": "ff97a7a0f5a9c5aba1086d0e61928a11e22b0672f1fd7329e46b2887723b3448",
      "context": "Using promoted attributes to configure scripts > Using check boxes to toggle flags",
      "contextHash": "80082c340ed62fddd93cdfe7a602e70140767e4e7412b2735010cfbb471ae10e",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "これを行うには、まず昇格された属性を定義します。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_08a9c1b13326ece340240c8c_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Then use it:",
      "sourceHash": "08a9c1b13326ece340240c8cbadda3542a613711045bfb85fd08ce5b017145cc",
      "context": "Using promoted attributes to configure scripts > Using check boxes to toggle flags",
      "contextHash": "80082c340ed62fddd93cdfe7a602e70140767e4e7412b2735010cfbb471ae10e",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "次に、それを使用します。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_27c0737e69e6738b29a2fd45_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "This will work equally well in both front-end and back-end scripts.",
      "sourceHash": "27c0737e69e6738b29a2fd4596a058b1f575f420fb5c186e6193d0f337cb6da5",
      "context": "Using promoted attributes to configure scripts > Using check boxes to toggle flags",
      "contextHash": "80082c340ed62fddd93cdfe7a602e70140767e4e7412b2735010cfbb471ae10e",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "これは、フロントエンドスクリプトとバックエンドスクリプトの両方で同様に機能します。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_1f828b7d7d1e414018a997b6_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Using relations to select notes__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "1f828b7d7d1e414018a997b6ff34151e917caac39fcf5d350e30a5c97f987e02",
      "context": "Using promoted attributes to configure scripts > Using relations to select notes",
      "contextHash": "987a8d460600877b00155622d45e708360481c9db8a911c125596094c73f55c7",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "リレーションを使用したノートの選択__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_fe66448590b748941cf6e228_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "One common use case for a script is to read data from another note and perhaps output its result in another note. To do so we need to define the following promoted attributes:",
      "sourceHash": "fe66448590b748941cf6e228ecfbf0c016d0c48a34c20fd443c6358086174cb4",
      "context": "Using promoted attributes to configure scripts > Using relations to select notes",
      "contextHash": "987a8d460600877b00155622d45e708360481c9db8a911c125596094c73f55c7",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "スクリプトの一般的なユースケースとして、別のノートからデータを読み取り、場合によってはその結果を別のノートに出力するというものがあります。これを行うには、次の昇格された属性を定義する必要があります。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a8324355d8e9f00e35b0851d_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Once we have this, we can add some basic error handling to ensure that the fields are completed by the user:",
      "sourceHash": "a8324355d8e9f00e35b0851db9c91f7fb98497865195050ee7070ee87136ed49",
      "context": "Using promoted attributes to configure scripts > Using relations to select notes",
      "contextHash": "987a8d460600877b00155622d45e708360481c9db8a911c125596094c73f55c7",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "これらが用意できたら、ユーザーによってフィールドが入力されていることを確認するための基本的なエラー処理を追加できます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_53e821a0cee6d53cbe89c9c5_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Note that here we are using __TRILIUM_PH_0__ which is only available for frontend notes. If you are writing a backend note, simply remove __TRILIUM_PH_1__ but the user will no feedback on why the script did not execute properly.",
      "sourceHash": "53e821a0cee6d53cbe89c9c589ce66d4284b19ca87c461133b9f8ed45c1a9930",
      "context": "Using promoted attributes to configure scripts > Using relations to select notes",
      "contextHash": "987a8d460600877b00155622d45e708360481c9db8a911c125596094c73f55c7",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "ここでは、フロントエンドノートでのみ利用可能な __TRILIUM_PH_0__ を使用していることに注意してください。バックエンドノートを作成している場合は、単に __TRILIUM_PH_1__ を削除してください。ただし、その場合、ユーザーはスクリプトが正常に実行されなかった理由に関するフィードバックを受け取ることができません。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_80a1d4f416bd1be40f3e302d_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Afterwards we can simply read the note and do something with it:",
      "sourceHash": "80a1d4f416bd1be40f3e302d0fd8a146e476b4fd545dc6f9842e7fd577c6afab",
      "context": "Using promoted attributes to configure scripts > Using relations to select notes",
      "contextHash": "987a8d460600877b00155622d45e708360481c9db8a911c125596094c73f55c7",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "その後、単にノートを読み取って処理を実行できます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
